  "reasoning": "The defendants accepted large sums of money in exchange for illegally registering non‑eligible candidates for the college entrance exam, which constitutes acceptance of bribes (受贿罪). They also violated admission regulations by arranging the enrollment of these candidates, which falls under the crime of abusing power to facilitate admission (徇私舞弊罪). Additionally, Defendant 邓某 fabricated school and police seals to produce false academic and household registration certificates, meeting the elements of forging state documents (伪造国家机关公文罪). Therefore, the appropriate charges are acceptance of bribes, abuse of power to facilitate admission, and forgery of state documents.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]受贿;徇私舞弊;伪造国家机关公文<eoa>"
}

